        <body>
            <div xml:id="d122">

                <pb facs="0398" n="366" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v10/pg366"/>

                <head>122. Memorandum From the Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Economic
                    Affairs (Kalijarvi) to the
                        Secretary of State<anchor n="1" xml:id="d122-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1956-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic">June 6,
                        1956</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>China Trade Controls Problem</item>
                </list>
                <p>The attached paper (Tab A), cleared by EUR,
                        FE, and S/P,
                    has been prepared as a report by you to the NSC
                    regarding (a) the status of talks with the UK and
                    Japan on the China trade control problem <pb facs="0399" n="367" xml:id="pg367"
                    /> and (b) alternative courses of action for resumption of discussions with
                    these countries and other Participating Countries (PC’s). Mr. Hoover, in your
                    absence, asked that the paper be coordinated with the CFEP prior to submission to the NSC.</p>
                <p>The alternative courses of action are set forth in paragraphs 7 and 8 of the
                    paper (Tab A).</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Recommendation</hi></p>
                <p>It is recommended that you approve the attached paper for submission to the
                        NSC after coordination with the CFEP.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d122-f2"/></p>




                <xi:include href="d122-a1.xml" xpointer="d122-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d122-a2.xml" xpointer="d122-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
